[Event "Knight School"]
[Opening "Queen's Pawn Game"]
[Variation "Richter-Veresov Attack, Black pushes e5"]
[ECO "D01"]
[Character "tactical"]
[Risk "medium"]
[EarlyMate "none"]
[Tricks "trap,pin"]
[Themes "pinned-knight"]
[Kind "against-us"]

1. d4 d5 2. Nc3 Nf6 3. Bg5 Nbd7 4. Nf3 e5? { Tries to take the centre, but the knight on f6 is pinned to the queen and White has an easy way to win a pawn. }
5. dxe5 ( 5. Nxe5?! Nxe5 6. dxe5 Ne4 )
5... h6 ( 5... Ne4 6. Bxd8 { The knight left f6, so the bishop takes the queen. } ) 6. Bxf6 gxf6 7. Qxd5 c6 8. Qe4 fxe5 9. Nxe5 *
